{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27969","headline":"送罗先辈书记归後却还闽中留别 · 朱庆余","name":"送罗先辈书记归後却还闽中留别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同是越人从小别，忽归乡里见皆惊。\n湖边访旧知谁在，幕下留欢但觉荣。\n望岭又生红槿思，登车岂倦白云程。\n况当季父承恩日，廉问南州政已成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}